# No dark UI

k-thread stays on the **light kube** shell. Do **not** ship dark backgrounds, black HUD canvases, or neon-on-black graph themes.

- Graph, landing, rails, dialogs: light washes (`--kube-*` / light `--hud-*` aliases)
- Accent red is fine as a **signal** on light surfaces
- Prefer the music-player flow language (rounded orthogonal wires, port dots, pills) adapted to light — not cyberpunk black
